/target
**/*.rs.bk
# Local-only scratch space — holds signing/notary credentials, never commit.
/ignore/
*.pdb
.DS_Store
.env
.env.local
node_modules
.wrangler
build/
# Staged web bundle for rust-embed — written by crates/engine/build.rs.
crates/engine/web-staging/
# Local agent tooling scratch (skills, per-agent instructions).
.agents/
agents.md
.claude
CLAUDE.md
# A literal `?` directory: a tool run with an unset HOME/ANDROID_USER_HOME
# writes `?/.android/…` into the CWD, and Windows cannot check out a path
# with `?` in it (ci-speed 22; runs 40472984016, 40473003282). Escaped:
# a bare `?` is a one-character wildcard.
/\?/
apps/android/\?/
